        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For example, the Restriction on the Use of Certain Hazardous Substances in Electrical and Electronic Equipment Directive (\"RoHS\"), the Registration, Evaluation, Authorisation, and Restriction of Chemicals (\"REACH\") and the Waste Electrical and Electronic Equipment Directive (\"WEEE\"), enacted in the European Union, regulate the use of certain hazardous substances, notification of customers of the presence of any substances of very high concern in products, and require the collection, reuse, and recycling of waste from, products we manufacture.",
