        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "However, our proteomics, genomics, and analytical instruments, reagents, and other consumables are currently intended for, labeled and sold only for RUO applications, and we sell them to academic institutions, life sciences and clinical research laboratories that conduct research, and biopharmaceutical and biotechnology companies for non-clinical and non-diagnostic purposes.",
